      "Which animals can I get?",
      "One of 16: Wolf, Eagle, Bear, Owl, Dolphin, Tiger, Fox, Elephant, Butterfly, Snake, Raven, Lion, Hummingbird, Turtle, Hawk or Deer. Each is assigned an element — seven are Air, three each Earth, Fire and Water."
