      "Shoulders covered and ankle-length trousers or a long skirt — below the knee is not enough at this site. Sleeveless tops, shorts, cropped tops, ripped jeans, see-through fabric and leggings worn as outerwear are refused at the gate. Wraps and trousers can be borrowed near the Wat Phra Kaew entrance against a deposit, but the queue is long enough that arriving dressed is faster."
