      "Under the rates notified from 1 June 2022 the annual third party premium is Rs 2,094 for cars up to 1000 cc, Rs 3,416 for 1001 to 1500 cc and Rs 7,897 above 1500 cc. GST of 18% is charged on top, and the owner-driver personal accident cover adds Rs 375 a year."
